# 🌦️ Weather Data Analysis

## 📌 Project Overview

This project focuses on analyzing and cleaning weather data using
Python and Pandas.

The dataset contains information about weather conditions such as
temperature, humidity, rainfall, wind speed, city, and weather
conditions.

The main goal of this project is to clean the dataset, convert
incorrect data types, and prepare the data for further analysis
and visualization.

---

## 🎯 Objectives

- Clean and prepare the weather dataset
- Identify incorrect data types
- Convert numerical columns into appropriate data types
- Handle missing or invalid values
- Explore weather patterns
- Prepare the dataset for analysis and visualization

---

## 📊 Dataset Columns

| Column | Description |
|---|---|
| `Weather_Date` | Date of the weather record |
| `City` | City where the weather was recorded |
| `Temperature_C` | Temperature in Celsius |
| `Humidity_Percent` | Humidity percentage |
| `Rainfall_mm` | Rainfall measurement in millimeters |
| `Wind_Speed_kmh` | Wind speed in kilometers per hour |
| `Weather_Condition` | General weather condition |

---

